@startuml
title D-06 Continuity and Exception Reporting Flow

actor "Operations Manager" as Ops
participant "Operator Console /\nContinuity Workflow" as OC
participant "Assisted Payment Terminal\nContinuity Terminal Mode" as CT
participant "Central PMS" as CPMS
participant "Site POS Server" as POS
participant "Reconciliation Workflow" as Recon
participant "Management Dashboard" as Dash

OC -> Dash : Continuity activation,\ndeactivation,\npost-restoration review state
CT -> Dash : Continuity Terminal\nactivation visibility
CPMS -> Dash : Payment uncertainty,\nExitAuthorization status,\nmanual release records
POS -> Dash : Fiscal exception\npending/failed/succeeded status
Recon -> Dash : Reconciliation backlog\nand closure status
Ops -> Dash : Review degraded state,\nexceptions, backlog, SLA

note over Dash
Dashboard visibility does not activate continuity,
approve manual release, close reconciliation,
or bypass Operator Console / Continuity controls.
end note
@enduml
